Affiliation = {Wilson, AE (Corresponding Author), Brigham Young Univ, NSF Ctr Space High Performance \& Resilient Comp S, Provo, UT 84602 USA.
   Wilson, Andrew E.; Larsen, Sam; Wilson, Christopher; Thurlow, Corbin; Wirthlin, Michael, Brigham Young Univ, NSF Ctr Space High Performance \& Resilient Comp S, Provo, UT 84602 USA.},
