   ITALY, JUN 29-JUL 01, 2021},
Abstract = {The CakeML project has developed a proof-producing code generation
   mechanism for the HOL4 theorem prover, a verified compiler for ML and,
   using these, a number of verified application programs that are proved
   correct down to the machine code that runs them (in some cases, even
   down to the underlying hardware). The purpose of this extended abstract
   is to tell the story of the project and to point curious readers to
   publications where they can read more about specific contributions.},
